window.products.push({"id":518017,"name":"Pumpkin Spice Soy Candle | Holiday Home Fragrance Peppercorn + Orange + Apple + Mandarin | Stocking Stuffer Secret Santa Gift Mom - 8 oz.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-oDtZ9BeL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The log fire is burning and the entire family is home. The only thing that is missing is a hand-poured scented candle that is gently infusing your home with a heavenly seasonal scent. As the autumnal leaves fall from the trees outside, you are feeling blessed and relaxed by the warm flickering light of your beautiful candle.   \"Pumpkin Spice\" is a peppery twist on a traditional holiday fruit fragrance. Freshly cracked peppercorn blends with orange peel and mandarin for a spiced citrus treat. Tonka bean and vanilla in the base smooth out the zesty orange notes. Black pepper, clove leaf, and orange essential oils enhance the juicy citrus and piquant spice of this realistic scent.  Top: Orange Peel, Peppercorn  Middle: Apple, Mandarin  Base: Vanilla, Tonka Bean   Natural soy candles have become an indispensable part of your interior design style and have the power to transform your space and create an idyllic atmosphere. Whichever fall scent candle you choose, you will help your loved ones create cherished memories.   CANDLE INFO:  Jar Size: 9oz | 8oz Net Weight | 2.75 x 2.75 x 3.5\"  Wax: 100% Soy Wax | Made in the USA  Premium Fragrance Oil  Gluten Free, Phthalate Free, Cruelty-Free   CANDLE CARE:  Trim Your Wick to 1/4\" Before Candle is Lit Each Time  Burn Candle so Wax Pool Reaches the Jar Edge Each Time to Prevent Wax Tunneling  Burn Candle No More Than 4 Hours at a Time  Keep Candle Away from Fans, Open Windows, Hot Surfaces, Children, Pets  Never Leave a Burning Candle Unattended","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-oDtZ9BeL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jarful House","source_asin":"B09D7SMBZ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-518017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D7SMBZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D7SMBZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
