window.products.push({"id":518022,"name":"Moonice Cordless Blackout Cellular Shades, Cellular Blinds for Windows Door, Customize Honeycomb Window Blinds & Shades for Home Kitchen Bedroom Child","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B+veBkK6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Excellent Fabric & Modern blind】Cordless cellular blinds & shades for windows are made of thick non-woven fabric with aluminum foil, modern look, 100% blackout, ideal for a restful night's sleep and a good rest during the day! Unique honeycomb structure blocks cold wind in winter and harsh sunlight UV rays and heat in summer, helping to save energy costs, noise reduction and privacy. Ideal for bedroom, Living room, Kitchen, bathroom, office, children's room or any where need blackout sunlight. 【Smooth & Quiet Blind/Shade】High quality headrail & Bottom rail, The Robust constant force spring-loaded mechanism has passed 8,000 times lifting or pulling down tests for each cordless window blinds and shades makes it easy to raise and lower. it will stay at whatever position you stop, the bottom aluminum rail is weighted and rigid so it hangs flat and prevents from wind blowing. Easily resist the wind and the sun, Moonice shades and blinds is just to protect your day and night! 【Upgraded Cordless Cellular Blinds】Cordless blinds for windows,easy to install and hang. The cordless design is not only neat and beautiful, Our upgraded robust spring-loaded mechanism but also protects the safety of children and pets, and has been certified \"Best for Kids\". Provide a safe environment for your children and pets with our cordless blinds. Cordless cellular blinds are easy to lift. Gently push up or pull down, you can pull the curtain to any position you want. 【Easy to Install and Clean】The Cellular blinds can be installed inside or outside the window frame, Use the accessories included with the product to install easily. For inside mount, Window deep greater than 1.5\", shades width reduce 1/4\", shades length that is at least add 2-8 inches. For outside mount, Honeycomb Blinds need to be 4-12 inches wider and longer than window width and length for better coverage. Easy to install. In terms of cleaning, it can be wiped with a damp cloth. 【Customer Service】Moonice ensures that you are 100% satisfied. We provide custom service to make sure the blind can fit your window perfectly. If you can not find correct size on the size list, you can click the \"Custom size\" in the list. Moonice offers a 1-year warranty on all our products, during which we will repair/replace them free of charge.Feel free to ask any questions up front to ensure your window treatment comes exactly as you expect it.Your satisfaction is our greatest happiness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B+veBkK6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"moonice","source_asin":"B0BN5892GD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-518022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN5892GD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN5892GD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
