window.products.push({"id":518432,"name":"EGYPTIAN COTTON DRYFAST 6 PIECE TOWEL BY MARTEX - 2 Bath Towels, 2 Hand Towels, 2 Wash Cloths - Premium, Luxurious, Top Hotel Quality - Soft, Absorben","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815rcgw5WrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EGYPTIAN COTTON DRYFAST TOWEL COLLECTION BY MARTEX  Celebrating superior quality and everyday style, the Martex Egyptian Cotton Towel Collection with DryFast offers upgraded softness and absorbency, with a generous size and your choice of rich color. Made with the extra-long fibers of premium Egyptian Cotton (which helps create stronger, fluffier loops), each towel offers an unmatched experience you’ll enjoy every time you step out of the tub or shower. Plus, easy care with included DryFast Technology means less dryer time and less energy when machine washing. The Intelliweave process orients the synthetic fibers's molecular structure so that there is minimal structural stress and therefore are significantly stronger and more stable than natural fibers. These synthetic fibers are woven into the underweave of the towel, giving it the durability and quick-dry properties, while ensuring nothing but 100% Egyptian Cotton loops touch your skin. 100% Egyptian Cotton Loops; Ground: 90% Cotton, 10% Polyester 100% Egyptian Cotton Loops; Ground: 90% Cotton, 10% Polyester Available in a variety of colors including Black, Black Plum, Cobblestone, Dark Aqua, Dark Brown, Dusty Blue, Engine Red, French Blue, Grey, Mineral Blue, Navy, Pine Bark, Sand, and White Available in a variety of colors including Black, Black Plum, Cobblestone, Dark Aqua, Dark Brown, Dusty Blue, Engine Red, French Blue, Grey, Mineral Blue, Navy, Pine Bark, Sand, and White Available individually: Body Sheet, Bath Towel, Hand Towel, Wash Cloth, or a 6 Piece set Available individually: Body Sheet, Bath Towel, Hand Towel, Wash Cloth, or a 6 Piece set Machine washable with DryFast Technology for shorter drying time Machine washable with DryFast Technology for shorter drying time ABOUT MARTEX With quality that families have counted on for over a century, Martex continues its legacy of great value, affordability, and everyday style. Martex is manufactued by WestPoint Home. Proudly boasting American heritage, WestPoint Home is owned and operated across several locations in the United States. All products are designed and developed in the heart of New York City, while behind-the-scenes operations are run out of Clemson, South Carolina. Since 1983, the Chipley Florida facitlity has operated as one of the most efficient cut-and-sew operations in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815rcgw5WrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Martex","source_asin":"B0100WIJBE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-518432","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0100WIJBE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0100WIJBE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":518433,"name":"Framatic Frameless Clip Frames 8 in. x 10 in.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41bObWL4N-L._AC_.jpg","description":"Stainless steel clips retained by injection molded buttons welded to a styrene black plastic back. A press of the finger releases the clips for loading, then returns the clips to secure glass and artwork. The clips adjust to accommodate up to a double mat. The buttons serve as hangers as well as floating the frame 1/2 in. away from the wall. Edges of the glass are ground smooth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41bObWL4N-L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Framatic","source_asin":"B003CVM9ZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-518433","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003CVM9ZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003CVM9ZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":518434,"name":"Michael Aram White Orchid Cheese Board w/ Knife, Small","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oGNXNQx2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Michael Aram white Orchid collection illuminates the ethereal spirit of the Orchid flower. Evocative of purity, delicacy, femininity and grace, the white metal version offers a strikingly different appeal than its black counterpart. While the sculpture is just as exuberant and detailed, in white, these flowers take on a simplicity that is completely unique. There is a sense of lightness, freshness and even innocence - each Petal seemingly untouched and pure. \"Orchids naturally emit a sense of sensuality and seductiveness, but in white nickel they take on a completely different meaning - an element of brightness that I associate with new beginnings. When I think of white orchids, I imagine the purity and sweetness of a newborn child, or a newlywed couple at the beginning of their lifelong journey.\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oGNXNQx2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MICHAEL ARAM","source_asin":"B06W57WWWD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-518434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06W57WWWD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06W57WWWD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":518435,"name":"KGORGE Bathroom Shower Curtains - Waterproof and Washable Privacy Bath Curtains Grey Ombre and Natural Tree Pattern, 72 x 72 inches, Hooks Included, 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jpA2vJ3+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PACKAEGE INCLUDES - 1 Panel shower curtain with 12 free hooks. Measures 72 in width and 72 in length, which is sure to fit most bathtubs and shower stalls. WATER RESISTANT - Waterproof and quick dry material help curtains withstand moisture-rich bathroom environment. It also prevents water splashing outside the bath area floor to keep your home clean and dry. DIGITAL PRINTING - Digital printing technology makes the pattern to be odorless, clear, vivid and not easily fading. Easy Match - Single gradient color combine with natural tree pattern can easily coordinate with any bathroom decorations and give your bathroom a fresh and clean look. It's also a good divider to separate the bathtubs with other areas，providing a good privacy for you. Easy Care - Durable polyester material is easy to maintain and machine washable. Tumble dry low.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jpA2vJ3+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KGORGE","source_asin":"B08XN6FBJJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-518435","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XN6FBJJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XN6FBJJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":518436,"name":"Beverage Factory 630SSCOMBO Per Lick 630SS Beer Faucet Stainless Shank Combo Kegerator Keg Tap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41E-tX5RyKL.jpg","description":"This Perlick 630SS Stainless Faucet and Stainless Steel Beer Shank setup allows the beer to only touch stainless steel. Perlick Perl Forward Sealing Stainless Steel Faucet features a sealing design that seals the faucet near the spout end of the faucet, not at the rear like most other designs. This means there is less faucet area exposed to keep clean, and that area is easier to clean. The stainless steel beer shank has a 4-1/8\" length with 3/16\" Bore and a 3/16\" ID stainless hose nipple. Conventional wisdom has no place at Perlick. That's because Perlick's drive for innovation is legendary, leaving convention for the other guys to play with. Now, wisdom in general. . . well, that's another story. The new Perl Stainless Faucet from Perlick is a classic example. Its revolutionary Perl ball and floating O-ring design eliminates the need for a valve shaft. Beer gets no exposure to air; there's literally no space for mold and bacteria to grow. The Perl Faucet has fewer internal parts for better reliability. This shank is 4-1/8\" long with 3/16\" Bore. A shank is used to attach a beer line to a faucet. The shank is mounted through a 1\" hole in a wall, refrigerator door, cabinet, etc. The shank comes with a black flange on the front and a compression ring on the back. The compression ring is used to secure the shank to the mounting surface. All shanks come fitted with a stainless tail piece for beer line connection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41E-tX5RyKL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beverage Factory","source_asin":"B0055B4AR8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-518436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0055B4AR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0055B4AR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
