window.products.push({"id":518556,"name":"Cherry Home 52-Inch-by-96-Inch Velvet Blackout Grommet Curtain Panel, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41BVSHk06EL._AC_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for an exceptional selection of classic velvet curtains? Do you want light blocking curtains that will keep your home insulated while keeping light out? Then you are in the right place! You won't find a lower price on such a big selection of high-quality drapes. They helps keep the light out and insulates your home against heating or cooling loss. Cherry Home Drapes also offers velvet curtains in more than a lot of colors. Choose from royal blues to dark blacks and even royal reds. The goal is for you to have the best selection possible so that our draperies exactly match your needs.Decorating your home in vintage furniture, accessories, and art is a lovely way to showcase your individual style and these vintage curtains are a great addition. Whether you’re going all out and including vintage or vintage-inspired items in every room, or you’re just adding a few vintage flairs, these are the curtains that can make a believer out of anyone. 1.Sold as single panel, order more quantity to create fullness and coverage 2.Cherry Home curtains are tested for Energy Efficient at an independent third party laboratory.3.Add a touch of luxury to your home with solid velvet curtain panel ,it's rich color coordinates well with any room setting. 4.Super soft 100-Percentage flannel heavy weight velvet matt finish, unlined. 5.Blocks out 90% of light and 100% of UV ray6.Soft plush pile Velvet Curtains have a natural luster with a depth of color that creates a formal, polished look.7.Made of high-quality, poly velvet and soft flowing polyester blackout thermal lining.8.The curtains keep the light out and provides for optimal insulation.9.As a general rule, for proper fullness panels should measure 2-3 times the width of your window/opening.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41BVSHk06EL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cherry Home","source_asin":"B01HXFGRHY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-518556","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HXFGRHY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HXFGRHY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
