window.products.push({"id":518677,"name":"Westmark Apple Slicer, Cuts 10 Even Slices, Easy to use Apple Corer Made of Coated Aluminum and Stainless Steel Blades Save time multiple slices at on","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5118K9RLCzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Bringing satisfaction to customers all over the country, WESTMARK Germany’s Apple Slicer has entered a league of its own when it comes to its apple peeler corer slicer. Customers rave about this fruit slicer and how it is the sharpest and most reliable apple corer slicer peeler that they have ever owned! And there are a couple of main reasons why that is.  You See WESTMARKS Germany Apple and Pear Slicer was designed and built in the heartland of Germany where the best manufacturers and engineers in the world live. So they created an Apple and Pear slicer with high quality stainless steel blades and an aluminum handle that is both light and strong, so you can push through your apple or pear without any effort!    Life in the kitchen is so much easier when you use the accurate tool for the task! Westmark apple corer cuts out the core and makes equal wedges in one swift motion – a wonderful ease whenever you’re cooking, baking, or preparing salads with apples. Features: Specially Sharpened Blade Assembly  Dimensions: 110 x 170 x 40 mm  Material: Coated Aluminum, Stainless Steel Blade Unit (spot welded) About the Brand: HIGHEST QUALITY WITH TREND AND TRADITION Westmark of Germany is well known for its quality craftsmanship of kitchen gadgets. Westmark has been making reliable kitchen products for over 50 years. As a specialized and reliable partner Westmark offers a wide range of practical and uncomplicated kitchen products designed to make cooking and life in the kitchen easier. For traditional reasons, Westmark produces most of their products in Elspe, Germany. Money Back Guarantee: If you are not 100% satisfied with your Apple Slicer by WESTMARK, then simply return your set to Amazon for a full refund, no questions asked!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5118K9RLCzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Westmark","source_asin":"B014PW1AG6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-518677","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014PW1AG6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014PW1AG6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
