window.products.push({"id":518796,"name":"Crystal Clear Ice Ball Maker - 2.35 Inch Large Round Clear Ice Ball Spheres","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91woEpZYwiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ice mold makes 2 large crystal clear ice spheres, perfect for a pour of your favorite spirit or craft cocktail. To use the mold, simply fill with water and place in the freezer overnight. The insulated sleeve causes the ice to freeze from the top down, forcing any bubbles or impurities to the bottom of the mold.No need to buy expensive purified water or boiled water. Once frozen simply break the mold apart to release your clear ice Spheres, and enjoy. Once released from the mold they may be hazy, but just run them through the water for less than a second and they will be crystal clear. Makes 2 - 2.5\" crystal clear ice Spheres.    Clear Ice Cube, Clear Ice, ice tray, ice mold, ice cube, whiskey ice, brandy ice, clear ice cube, craft cocktail, old fashioned, Manhattan, whiskey sour, Craft ice, men gift, beer gift, whiskey gift, wedding gift, Clear Ice Maker, Clear Ice Tray, whiskey ice mold, brandy ice mold, Vodka ice mold, tequila ice mold, Whiskey Glass","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91woEpZYwiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"312 Market Place","source_asin":"B082RLDZWT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-518796","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082RLDZWT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082RLDZWT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":518797,"name":"Massive Silicone Pastry Mat, Extra Large 32 x 24 Inches, Non-Slip, Non-Stick, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZxNLK90FS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Everyday baking with sweet memories to show for it Do you wake up to a messy kitchen after evening baking? LIBGEYA huge pastry mat is made for easy-going bakers like you. The texture comes with a thick and non-sticky design. No slipping. Highlighted features Hence, you can start baking with no stress. Our silicone/glass fiber mat includes the following features: Exciting Benefits Baking just got easier — no more extra hours in the kitchen. Whenever you crave a taste of those hand-made fancy chocolates, pasta, pastries, or pizza, you can always bake with your heart. Stick-resistant surface Roll dough, shape bread, and groom butter without getting a sticky surface. Our baking mat keeps your dough smooth and appealing to eyesight. Best of all, it makes cleaning super easy. BPA-free Material Prepare pastries that are safe for consumption. Better still, taste real delight from those tasty cakes, fancy chocolates, pizzas, buttery dough, or whatever you're making. Easy Cleaning Our silicone mat makes cleaning swift. Plus, it dries quickly. Soft & Durable Design Enjoy a soothing design capable of lasting for an extended period while complementing other kitchen accessories. LIBGEYA Pastry mat needs no spray or oil for baking. Instead, it helps you to keep your loved ones healthy with your tasty recipes.  Also, you can use this mat in a oven/microwave oven and still get an intact design. You never have to worry about making a replacement for an extended period. This mat retains its red pie crust pattern and non-sticky texture without the need for sprays of other chemicals. From now on, you can start baking with pure flour, flavors—no extra applications.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZxNLK90FS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIBGEYA","source_asin":"B091FRF147","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-518797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091FRF147","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091FRF147","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
