window.products.push({"id":518948,"name":"FREE VILLAGE 47'' Bladeless Tower Fan - 47 Inch Portable Tower Fan with Remote, 15 Hours Timer, 70¡ã oscillation, LCD Display, Compact Size, 3 Modes a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6115fTt6XJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"??3 wind modes and 3 wind speeds: 3 wind modes, normal/natural/sleep. You can set the wind mode and speed according to your needs. High speed brings you strong wind energy and quickly releases heat; medium speed provides natural and comfortable wind, which will accompany you when you are reading, watching TV, or working. Low speed is more suitable for sleep, the elderly and children can also use our tower fan to sleep peacefully. ??LCD Display and Electronic remote control: The large LCD screen and simple remote control make it easy to use our tower fan. You can adjust the tower fan by pressing the button on the top of the remote control, and you can see the work status of the tower fan in real-time and the Current room temperature on the LCD interface. You can also use the remote control to start or adjust the fan from a distance of 6 meters. A wide time range of 1~15 hours meets the needs of most people. ??Space-saving: This vertical ultra-thin tower fan only occupies a compact space of 8.7 * 7.5 inches. It is actually a space-saving device that can provide enough wind energy to offset the heat and bring you a cool breeze in hot weather. Weighing 11.5 pounds, you can easily move the fan and place it anywhere in the room. ??Aerodynamics interactive experience: Using aerodynamics technology, tower fans allow air to flow through the entire house. When the tower fan and the air conditioner are used together, as the tower fan swings, you can feel the cool wind no matter where you are in the room, thus saving electricity. ??Home safety: The stable base prevents falls. Due to the bladeless design, it is very safe in families with pets and children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6115fTt6XJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FREE VILLAGE","source_asin":"B08TGSHV8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-518948","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TGSHV8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TGSHV8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
